Nenapu — third-party attributions
=================================

The pet's shape is derived from the dog-face glyph of Noto Emoji, rendered and
reduced to braille by tools/render_pet.py. The generated rows live in
src/nenapu/pet_art.py; no font file is bundled or required at runtime.

